 wonder and discovery for one and all\n\nDay the eighth return to Tokyo for a final night's repose\nReflect on the wonders seen and the memories that forever propose\nTo cherish the experiences and the people met along the way\nAs thou departest Japan's shores and bidest farewell to this fair day.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Fair", "logprob": -0.02102131024003029}, {"token": " traveler", "logprob": -0.01633308455348015}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -0.021408095955848694}, {"token": " see", "logprob": -0.08207069337368011}, {"token": "kest", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.3398338258266449}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.07988470792770386}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.24535402655601501}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.06839248538017273}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.003279693890362978}, {"token": " shore", "logprob": -1.646378755569458}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0015321184182539582}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.5631476044654846}, {"token": " land", "logprob": -0.0009628399857319891}, {"token": " of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " rising", "logprob": -0.708415687084198}, {"token": " sun", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.07897976785898209}, {"token": " myst", "logprob": -0.18619294464588165}, {"token": "ic", "logprob": -0.00027105904882773757}, {"token": " lore", "logprob": -0.0015568328090012074}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.01634926162660122}, {"token": "Th", "logprob": -0.6861558556556702}, {"token": "y", "logprob": -0.0003299065283499658}, {"token": " itinerary", "logprob": -0.9144690632820129}, {"token": " shall", "logprob": -1.2216784954071045}, {"token": " be", "logprob": -0.030594926327466965}, {"token": " thus", "logprob": -0.026567021384835243}, {"token": "ly", "logprob": -1.2664260864257812}, {"token": " penned", "logprob": -1.4380879402160645}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.6984537839889526}, {"token": " verse", "logprob": -0.012060359120368958}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -1.1139705181121826}, {"token"